{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-code-atlas#card-zh","repo":"qlheric/dsh-code-atlas","commit":"9b924dd4decc7ccb4888067043ae9c0fdb518c09","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Code Atlas（DSH 代码索引工具）：为代码仓库生成可核对的符号索引与文件地图。它通过 DSH 工具接口提供索引构建、地图、符号检索和 F/R/A/S 文件摘要。主要功能包括按依赖度排序文件、搜索符号、列出导出符号，以及标注文件职责和依赖关系。适合需要快速了解大型代码仓库的开发者。需要 Node.js 及两个 WASM 解析依赖，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:19-40","lib/tools.js:37-197","lib/atlas.js:72-84"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-code-atlas#card-en","repo":"qlheric/dsh-code-atlas","commit":"9b924dd4decc7ccb4888067043ae9c0fdb518c09","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Code Atlas adds tools to build a code index, map important files, search symbols, and view per-file summaries of duties, dependencies, exports, and constraints. It helps developers explore repositories and locate definitions. It requires Node.js and WASM parser packages; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:19-40","lib/tools.js:37-197","lib/atlas.js:72-84"]}
