{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-code-atlas#feature-1","repo":"qlheric/dsh-code-atlas","commit":"9b924dd4decc7ccb4888067043ae9c0fdb518c09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Code Atlas 的功能「代码仓库地图」：按导入者数量、可调用导出、代码行数和符号密度排序文件，并可按路径或职责关键词筛选。调用 code_atlas_map 获取文本或 JSON 结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:87-107","lib/fras.js:198-287"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-code-atlas#feature-2","repo":"qlheric/dsh-code-atlas","commit":"9b924dd4decc7ccb4888067043ae9c0fdb518c09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Code Atlas 的功能「符号检索」：按精确匹配、前缀和子串查找符号，并优先展示导出符号；结果包含文件、行号、种类和来源。调用 code_atlas_search 并提供 query。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:109-129","lib/fras.js:198-287"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-code-atlas#feature-3","repo":"qlheric/dsh-code-atlas","commit":"9b924dd4decc7ccb4888067043ae9c0fdb518c09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Code Atlas 的功能「筛选符号清单」：按名称、文件路径、符号种类筛选，并可只列导出符号；返回符号总数及有界结果列表。调用 code_atlas_symbols。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:131-158","lib/fras.js:198-287"]}
{"unit_id":"qlheric__dsh-code-atlas#feature-4","repo":"qlheric/dsh-code-atlas","commit":"9b924dd4decc7ccb4888067043ae9c0fdb518c09","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Code Atlas 的功能「F/R/A/S 文件摘要」：为每个文件给出职责、仓库内导入关系、导出入口和带行号的约束候选；支持路径、依赖者数量过滤。调用 code_atlas_fras。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/tools.js:160-195","lib/fras.js:198-287"]}
